rint-free front end, on by default'=>'Front end bez tragova, uključen podrazumevano','Foundation'=>'Temelj','Translation engines'=>'Mašine za prevođenje','What gets translated'=>'Šta se prevodi','Workflow'=>'Radni proces','SEO and URLs'=>'SEO i URL adrese','Language switcher'=>'Jezik ekrana','Developers'=>'Програмери','AI keys and models'=>'AI ključevi i modeli','Admin and licensing'=>'Administrator i licenciranje','More features'=>'Više funkcija','Licensing and support'=>'Licenciranje i podrška','Hosting built for fast, multilingual WordPress'=>'Hosting prilagođen za brz, višejezični WordPress','Managed WordPress hosting from the team that makes this plugin, tuned for speed and for sites in many languages.'=>'Upravljani WordPress hosting od tima koji je napravio ovaj dodatak, prilagođen za brzinu i za sajtove na mnogo jezika.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Pogledajte Zinn Digital® hosting','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Unajmite WordPress stručnjaka na platformi ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Tržište slobodnih profesionalaca za dizajn, razvoj, prevod i SEO rad za WordPress.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Posetite ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Masovni hosting sajtova i PBN-a','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd je naša platforma za istovremeno hostovanje i upravljanje većim brojem sajtova.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Posetite PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Nabavite Page Builder Sandwich Pro i Tranzly Pro zajedno','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Paket košta manje nego kupovina oba dodatka zasebno, sa istim paketima i ograničenjima sajtova.','See the bundle'=>'Pogledajte paket','Get %s'=>'Nabavite %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Integracija je aktivna: %1$s i %2$s rade zajedno','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of